# Inventory Management System Using C++

## Description
A C++ application developed to manage inventory records using structures, vectors and file handling.

## Technologies
- C++
- Structures
- Vectors
- File Handling

## Files
- main.cpp
- inventory.txt

## How to Run
1. Open the project in VS Code.
2. Open the terminal.
3. Compile:

   g++ main.cpp -o inventory

4. Execute:

   .\inventory.exe

